category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libprimecount8 libprimesieve12 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Fast prime counting function implementations (utilities)"
ldesc: "primecount is a command-line program and C/C++ library that counts the number
of primes ≤ x (maximum 10^31) using highly optimized implementations of the
combinatorial prime counting algorithms."

